## Guards

- `apps/web/test/thin-shell-post-binder-closure.spec.ts` — TS-4BZ-*
- Checklist authority: [`thin-shell-remaining-checklist.md`](./thin-shell-remaining-checklist.md) (promoted from gitignored `TEMP/THIN_SHELL_REMAINING_CHECKLIST.md` — Wave-0 / PSR-2c; do not reintroduce root `TEMP/` for CI)

### Logic — why promote the checklist

TS-4BZ-02/03 open the remaining checklist on every full `pnpm test` (Phase 0 integration → Phase 5 / `ci:integrity`). `TEMP/` is `.gitignore`d, so fresh clones and GHA runners hit `ENOENT`. Same pattern as Phase 18 agent-pack promotion (`docs/phase-18/agent-pack/`): clone-addressable bytes under `docs/dev/`, specs retargeted, Markdoc `extends` updated.
